==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Capy]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[CTO Seal]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Most of the typical [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] options such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island]]/[[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and crowd controllers like [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] do not work effectively as the CTO Seals outrange them. Instead, rangers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] are preferred.

